WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.211
"Watch this!" said Poppy.

2
00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:08.127
She took a deep breath.

3
00:00:08.128 --> 00:00:22.658
Bang! Her trunk flew open.

4
00:00:22.659 --> 00:00:31.416
Balloons flew out!

5
00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:35.183
Honk! Honk! Poppy tooted her horn.

6
00:00:35.184 --> 00:00:38.813
Eddy laughed hard.

7
00:00:38.814 --> 00:00:42.217
His dumper shook.

8
00:00:42.218 --> 00:00:45.577
"What's your name?" asked Poppy.

9
00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.711
Eddy told her.

10
00:00:47.712 --> 00:00:53.328
Two trucks rolled over.

11
00:00:53.329 --> 00:00:56.614
"Eddy," said Poppy.

12
00:00:56.615 --> 00:00:59.722
"Meet Dipper and Jeb."

13
00:00:59.723 --> 00:01:04.861
"I'm an ice cream truck," said Dipper.

14
00:01:04.862 --> 00:01:14.005
"I play music."

15
00:01:14.006 --> 00:01:17.919
"I move dirt," said Jeb.

16
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:23.800
He rolled off the lot.

17
00:01:23.801 --> 00:01:30.773
He scooped some dirt.

18
00:01:30.774 --> 00:01:34.010
"Hey, Eddy," said Jeb.

19
00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:36.757
"Want to carry this dirt?"

20
00:01:36.758 --> 00:01:39.561
"No, thanks," said Eddy.

21
00:01:39.562 --> 00:01:42.168
"I don't like to carry dirt."

22
00:01:42.169 --> 00:01:45.368
Everyone looked surprised.

23
00:01:45.369 --> 00:01:52.216
"What do you like to do?" asked Dipper.

24
00:01:52.217 --> 00:01:55.384
Eddy grinned.

25
00:01:55.385 --> 00:02:00.112
"I like to race!"

